# BoardGameGeek XML API token (required — the API rejects anonymous requests).
#
# 1. Register your app / request access and create a token at
#    https://boardgamegeek.com/using_the_xml_api
# 2. Copy this file to `.env` and paste your token below.
#    (.env is git-ignored; never commit your real token.)
#
# The pipeline sends it as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. You may paste just
# the token, or the full `Bearer <token>` value — both work.
#
# In GitHub Actions this is provided by the BGG_API_TOKEN repository secret,
# not this file.
BGG_API_TOKEN=
